{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-moor","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"moor-emaar-properties-dubai-creek-harbour","about":"Moor is a contemporary project by Emaar that offers cozy one, two or three-bedroom living spaces set in a picturesque park in the prestigious Dubai Creek Harbour area. Elegantly designed in the heart of international-class amenities, the building offers a convenient location, making access to Dubai's most famous attractions and beyond easy and seamless.Moor is uniquely designed, featuring a high standard of construction, innovative architectural solutions and sophisticated, spacious interiors with luxurious finishes to appeal to connoisseurs of modern urban waterfront living.The spacious dwellings are illuminated by natural light, adorned with balconies that open onto beautiful views of the creek and the pristine 700-meter beach, accessible just a few minutes' walk from the complex.Moor provides a unique living experience, offering residents many opportunities for recreation, privacy, relaxation and socialization. The complex features two town squares, a private pool, a shopping center with stores and restaurants, an outdoor fitness center, an outdoor play area, community room, barbecue area and a charming lawn where residents can enjoy an active lifestyle.Moor's convenient location provides residents with a quick commute around the city: only ten minutes separate the complex from Burj Khalifa and Downtown Dubai, and fifteen minutes from Dubai International Airport.","price":1628888,"title":"Moor","bitrix":{"id":712,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Moor","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Moor","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"Dubai Creek Harbour"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2354/images/2024/06/28/340x252/hf0PATtm4jI06QPwY1cFfENUp5s1K25bIzmrbkaB.webp